  "scientific_conclusion": "Empirical results prove that full-disk integrated soft X-ray time-series features provide only weak discriminative signal 30 minutes prior to flare onset (ROC-AUC 0.597, PR-AUC 0.216). Non-linear decision trees suffer severe negative transfer across different active region background regimes (ROC-AUC 0.384-0.394). Single-instrument soft X-rays alone cannot support an operational warning system without spatial magnetic field topology (vector magnetograms) and multi-wavelength EUV coronal imaging."
